  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 17
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: ' OK, I admit it. I am Lucifer.'
    portugueseLine: "Ok, eu admito. Eu sou L\xFAcifer. "
    chineseLine: "\u597D\uFF0C\u6211\u627F\u8BA4\u3002\u6211\u662F\u8DEF\u897F\u6CD5\u3002"
    spanishLine: ' Ok, lo admito. Soy Lucifer.'
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' GET OUT OF HERE, DEVIL! I mean, why are you helping us?'
    portugueseLine: SAI DAQUI CAPETA!  Digo, Por que ta ajudando a gente?
    chineseLine: "\u6EDA\u51FA\u53BB\uFF0C\u9B54\u9B3C!  \u6211\u662F\u8BF4\uFF0C\u4F60\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u5E2E\u6211\u4EEC?  "
    spanishLine: " \xA1FUERA DE AQU\xCD, DEMONIO! Digo, \xBFpor qu\xE9 nos est\xE1s
      ayudando?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: ' As I said, I want to go back home. But they stole my throne. '
    portugueseLine: 'Como eu disse, quero voltar pra minha casa. Mas roubaram meu
      trono. '
    chineseLine: "\u5982\u6211\u6240\u8BF4\uFF0C\u6211\u60F3\u56DE\u5BB6\u3002\u4F46\u6709\u4EBA\u62A2\u4E86\u6211\u7684\u738B\u4F4D\u3002"
    spanishLine: ' Como dije, quiero volver a mi hogar. Pero me robaron el trono. '
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: "I could beat that guy up, but honestly, I\u2019m tired of war.
      So I thought I\u2019d outsource the job to you guys."
    portugueseLine: "Eu poderia dar uma surra no cara, mas, sinceramente, to cansado
      de guerra. A\xED pensei em terceirizar o trabalho pra voc\xEAs. "
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u53EF\u4EE5\u63CD\u4ED6\u4E00\u987F\uFF0C\u4F46\u8001\u5B9E\u8BF4\uFF0C\u6211\u538C\u5026\u6218\u4E89\u4E86\u3002\u6240\u4EE5\u6211\u60F3\u628A\u6D3B\u4EA4\u7ED9\u4F60\u4EEC\u3002"
    spanishLine: "Podr\xEDa darle una paliza a ese tipo, pero sinceramente, estoy
      cansado de guerras. Entonces pens\xE9 en subcontratar el trabajo con ustedes."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' Hmm. Strange for the devil to be so nice. But it makes quite a
      bit of sense.'
    portugueseLine: "Humm. Estranho o capeta ser t\xE3o gente boa. Mas faz bastante
      sentido. "
    chineseLine: "\u55EF\u3002\u9B54\u9B3C\u8FD9\u4E48nice\u8FD8\u771F\u602A\u3002\u4F46\u786E\u5B9E\u633A\u6709\u9053\u7406\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Hmm. Extra\xF1o que el diablo sea tan buena onda. Pero tiene bastante
      sentido."
